stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Projected
  Projected --> Deferred: Choose Not now on a pending reply
  Deferred --> DetailLoaded: Open the refreshed deferred reply
  Deferred --> Projected: Deadline arrives and the email list shows the reply
  Projected --> DetailLoaded: Open the exact current card
  Projected --> Refused: Card changed, disappeared, resolved or unsupported
  Projected --> Refused: Another actor requests the card
  DetailLoaded --> OwnerSubmitted: Submit the displayed domain operation
  OwnerSubmitted --> Refreshed: Owner accepts, refresh Home
  OwnerSubmitted --> Refused: Owner refuses changed version or authority
  Refused --> Projected: Refresh Home and review again
  Refreshed --> Projected: Review remaining work
  %% never: Reading a card changes domain state.
  %% never: A Home operation bypasses the domain owner.
